{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_232_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，王二月，庚戌，盜弒蔡侯申。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"稱盜以弒君，不以上下道道也。內其君而外弒者，不以弒道道也。春秋有三盜：微殺大夫謂之盜，非所取而取之謂之盜，辟中國之正道以襲利謂之盜。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"二、蔡公孫辰出奔吳。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"三、葬秦惠公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"四、宋人執小邾子。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"五、夏，蔡殺其大夫公孫姓、公孫霍。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"六、晉人執戎蠻子赤歸於楚。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"七、城西郛。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"八、六月，辛丑，亳社災。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"亳社者，亳之社也。亳，亡國也。亡國之社以為廟，屏戒也。其屋亡國之社，不得上達也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"九、秋，八月，甲寅，滕子結卒。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"十、冬，十有二月，葬蔡昭公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_232_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_232","textTraditional":"十一、葬滕頃公。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}